            <ArticleTitle>Pseudoxanthoma elasticum and its complications: two case reports.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>24-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe 2 patients with pseudoxanthoma elasticum (PXE) and angioid streaks. In one patient PXE was complicated by cardiovascular disease. The other patient presented with acute visual decline in one eye after a minor blunt injury. Information about PXE and its complications is given.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
